  "body": "Our vendor's plans have changed and the instructions are clear - this property is to be sold! Having purchased in 2023, the vendor fully understands the market has moved and is prepared to meet the market. Forget the previous sale price and take advantage of a genuine opportunity to secure a beautifully renovated home in one of Auckland's most prestigious addresses. Call the agents for a price guide and prepare to be impressed.\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated to an exceptional standard, this stunning two bedroom residence delivers contemporary style, generous proportions and effortless lock-up and leave living. Featuring quality double-glazed joinery, stunning oak flooring, a designer kitchen, luxurious bathroom and spacious living and bedrooms, every detail has been thoughtfully crafted to create a sophisticated, low maintenance home.\r\n\r\nIdeal for busy professionals, downsizers, apartment alternative buyers or out of town owners wanting a convenient Auckland base. Investors will also appreciate the appeal of a quality, easy-care property in such a desirable location.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a leisurely stroll to local shops and cafes, the tranquil shores of Okahu Bay and the beautiful waterfront, with Mission Bay, Tamaki Drive and the CBD all within easy reach. This prestigious location offers an exceptional combination of lifestyle, convenience and accessibility.\r\n\r\nAdd the convenience of covered off-street parking, low outgoings and an on-site gardener and you have a city-side sanctuary that makes everyday living a breeze.\r\n\r\nThe vendor has made their intentions clear and is committed to achieving a sale. Disregard the 2023 purchase price, call us for a price guide and make sure you're in a position to participate at auction.",
